    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "PROPERTY PARTNERS O’ BRIEN SWAINE present a fantastic opportunity to acquire  this excellent two bedroomed ground floor apartment. No. 44 comes to the market boasting two double bedrooms, two balconies, electric gates at the entrance, secure designated parking and well maintained landscaped communal gardens.\r\n\r\nIdeally located in this quiet development just a short stroll from Clondalkin Village and within easy access to the M50 motorway  and a huge range of shops, schools aswell as sporting and recreational\r\n facilities . Regular bus services link Clondalkin with the city centre and the Luas park n ride is located at the nearby Red Cow stop.\r\n\r\nAccommodation briefly consists of entrance hallway, livingroom, kitchen, two bedrooms and a bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: 4.3m x 2.2m\r\nWood effect flooring, intercom, ESB fusebox, access to storage room  (1.8m x 0.9m)\r\n\r\nLivingroom/ Kitchen/ Dining Area: 4.3m x 5.4m\r\nWood effect flooring, TV point, door to balcony\r\nKitchen – Wall and floor mounted units, tiled floor and splashback, plumbed for stainless steel sink and washing machine, integrated oven, hob and extractor fan\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 3.0m x 3.4m\r\nWood effect flooring, patio door to balcony\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.5m x 3.1m\r\nWood effect flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.08m x 1.8m\r\nWC, WHB and bath, tiled floors and bath surround, wall hung mirror\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nCommunal gardens, underground parking, gated development"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Special Features\r\nElectric storage heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nTwo double bedrooms\r\nBright and spacious accommodation\r\nBuilt c.2004\r\nBER D2\r\nExtends to approximately 54 Sq metres\r\nManagement fees approx.: €2770 per annum\r\nMost recent rent €1,384 set April 2025 \r\n2 Balcony’s\r\nDesignated parking space\r\nExcellent location\r\nClose to shops, schools and public transport"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D2"
      }
    ],
